        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A bonnet of blue silk taffeta, unlined, the crown and brimmed shaped with inserted cane.  Trimmed with a bow of blue silk taffeta at the back and top of the crown.  The brim is semi-circular in shape and turns upward."@en ;
